  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: a survey of a .ll fixture prints 'Detected 1 llvm_ir file(s) but Llvm_Ir analyzer not installed. Install hypergumbo-lang-extended1' while emitting llvm_ir symbols. The probe 'llvm_ir' in _get_registered_analyzer_languages() gives False; the heuristic at partial_install_warnings.py:232-236 is unchanged. llvm_ir is the only LANGUAGE_PACKAGES key missing from the set. The message wording changed. MECHANISM: registered-language set guessed by splitting analyzer names instead of read from each analyzer's declared languages."  # f2f6
